<title>SWITZERLAND: SWISS EXCHANGE SUSPENDS RICHEMONT .</title>
<headline>SWISS EXCHANGE SUSPENDS RICHEMONT .</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Richemont AG were suspended on Friday, the stock exchange said, pending publication of an important announcement in the course of the afternoon.</p>
</text>
